            <div xml:id="m-dcc98c95-3789-4498-8fe0-4c85eba986b9">
              <lg xml:id="m-abc02c49-aeda-4065-878f-12712a30a498">
                <l xml:id="m-dbb082a8-6399-4b21-9075-6de988b75544" facs="#m-762d8099-7722-444b-ba93-863932949ad6" label="text-like">THE FIRST SUNDAY AFTER PENTECOST.</l><l xml:id="m-439af322-c9d2-4406-8654-5cf0fdfc1f40" facs="#m-11062bbe-4808-4546-bed4-005627f9d541" label="text-like">FEAST OF THE BLESSED TRINITY.</l><l xml:id="m-e0f2903b-9b52-4d1e-89b3-3e8da54251a8" facs="#m-c4d2c72e-bf58-4a8c-9722-d1c7364608d5" label="text-like">Double of the First Class.</l><l xml:id="m-9be02632-944d-415c-bea3-5c8e33668495" facs="#m-75ca06a6-ab4c-4dfd-9f35-f1fca8c96f89" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-3ac0cb74-01ab-4c09-a5fd-7938b9411917" facs="#m-83c37a07-8bef-457d-a1f8-9ed5ae9a2901" label="lyrics-like">All as at second Vespers, p. 914, except the fifth Psalm, which is Laudáte</l><l xml:id="m-88b5ea3a-0445-43aa-9ee4-a143f9187b6f" facs="#m-5703d7a4-d160-417c-99bb-ae4a62e7e842" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum 5. a. 168, and the following.</l><l xml:id="m-4416c782-6cef-4316-aa67-22fd23107db8" facs="#m-a055ac70-f6fa-4f1d-b507-e044e14c298a" label="lyrics-like">V. Benedicámus Pâtrem et Filium cum Sáncto Spiritu.</l><l xml:id="m-3b7ebdb3-4cab-486f-982b-b50c804f90a8" facs="#m-9649e016-3b89-4e78-a64c-ae48dbf9fe34" label="lyrics-like">K. Laudémus et superexaltémus éum in saécula.</l><l xml:id="m-6d894aca-652b-4735-a04c-f60dafa32e5d" facs="#m-05328aa8-a695-4005-99ef-fc4f16a798e2" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-eba35de4-f627-44c0-9bcc-5022291f17d7" facs="#m-838d0479-a0b9-48e7-885c-5957ec48203d" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.D</l><l xml:id="m-975927a7-b4b9-45d1-960e-be319652fabf" facs="#m-71d85024-90b4-40dd-9b21-af1cd6ef0545" label="lyrics-like">Rá-ti-as“t-bi Dé-us, grá- ti-as tí-bi vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-0bbd52e4-ef6f-4a40-861b-75026fc5accb" facs="#m-137dce36-48e8-4f27-ad31-189daf4449d5" label="lyrics-like">ra et ú¬ na Trí¬ ni-tas : ú- na et súmma</l><l xml:id="m-95e2625c-1d6c-48bd-8762-25a2e1b1c119" facs="#m-5f1a573a-f73c-407a-b1f4-1a85efa83d55" label="lyrics-like">Dé- i-tas: sán- cta et ú-na Uni-tas. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-5fef35eb-fe25-4718-accb-6551b934abe3" facs="#m-83aec2bd-88ad-4b0a-8b64-d25c860f6888" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 1. D. p. 207 or p. 213. — Prayer. Omnípotens. p. 910.</l><l xml:id="m-af7167df-835e-463f-b4d8-1ebe22d26359" facs="#m-720ae2ac-0343-4add-aa70-c25c8ec284b2" label="text-like">Commemoration of the first Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-9d1495a5-141a-4fb9-8b7b-688b083939af" facs="#m-b06b6b69-3a56-49ce-8cce-c33300fc2255" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-ccf99b4b-92b3-400d-9b2d-51f678743ee0" facs="#m-21066af8-17ac-4732-bdf5-dc0d09f068f4" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-f83c6c48-65f0-4565-a38d-b79bfd4f4a31" facs="#m-966dc2b7-1395-4727-8e57-3901dacc3800" label="lyrics-like">AOquere Dómine, “qui-a áu- dit sérvus tú-us.</l><l xml:id="m-2afb5dd8-3662-4bdf-a5c2-efd4af72cfd5" facs="#m-d4bff23a-4fbd-4984-9aeb-fc048372f2fc" label="lyrics-like">V. Vespertína orátio ascéndat ad te Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-b284d85a-b5ca-4303-bcaa-eeca5622965c" facs="#m-7d0fcc7c-af8d-49e8-841a-0a3d8a0ca368" label="lyrics-like">R. Et descéndat super nos misericórdia túa.</l><l xml:id="m-b0607853-e53e-4ea8-9739-882d8f5a364a" facs="#m-106701b6-5737-4e08-b5a6-63e59b475c7b" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, in te sperántium. p. 910.</l><l xml:id="m-dc0f061f-2aef-44d6-9072-43517566962f" facs="#m-a2ce2af4-d1fc-4be6-a0d4-1ea6143ec3b5" label="text-like">Compline of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-195745e7-59f9-43e0-afc4-860ebd5322aa" facs="#m-a459dcbf-5b18-4b7e-8d65-8a403806816b" label="text-like">AT LAUDS.</l><l xml:id="m-4c07b003-9664-46be-aaf2-29105fff8675" facs="#m-7f3d6a9e-8d82-4600-a593-3c62576583a8" label="text-like">Antiphons of second Vespers, p. 914. Psalms of Feasts, p. 221.</l><l xml:id="m-a0820d9b-09fb-4592-8995-c2f8d98a8279" facs="#m-4a5d72af-2558-4518-abec-ea59add64eef" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. O altitúdo divitiárum. 915.</l><l xml:id="m-8846df96-d2ac-47b3-adac-68174ab73242" facs="#m-22897cda-0d14-490a-a7fe-bcf5e3bd8c87" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-b3f25711-7327-46a5-a453-336ff58ae5d6" facs="#m-a976cf02-ed7c-44a3-9534-eadc948d70e1" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-c6152a96-5339-4218-a5c0-278f226b2a67" facs="#m-ff21e897-3757-42f1-a6d8-0430d354cc27" label="lyrics-like">U Tri-ni-tá-tis Uni-tas, Orbem poténter quae ré¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>